Output demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 920
Set Height 440
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "alias beflow='bash /home/corrm/plane-workflow/media/demo.sh'" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show

Type "beflow watch APP"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 22000ms
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1500ms
